{"title":"2021 JMPSC Accuracy Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Accuracy_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/9/069e14d8586e65674ce72115fbc3d3672d0bf3af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+2}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" /> is its own reciprocal, find the product of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3be04db73828946870d3ccc6d122395a4bacf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Accuracy_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the problem, we know that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084ba26663f54c49ab1cc045a6710c05e5843809.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x+2}{6} = \\frac{6}{x+2}\\]\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1cebe541195727db299f5d827dc3c38ea8f5f0c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+2)^2 = 6^2\\]\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c68bff3f7be269a66cee441e05efb0404d296798.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+ 4x + 4 = 36\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/c/5ec8a29a9ec397d5803258fbfcde923cca7929f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + 4x - 32 = 0\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09a49ac7d7d7bcf4e031867a0ba5d9dda7529b5f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+8)(x-4) = 0\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bbfc6ff401ab655510610524e1fb71f747d6576.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -8$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e67be45136d821acba184799025d16a93832e1e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-8) \\cdot 4=\\boxed{-32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"129\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~Bradygho\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Accuracy_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/0/7b015d760089f09e5f4bd9e5627ba659f4c93721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+2}{6} = \\frac{6}{x+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"117\" height=\"40\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c52576fa3acf31dff7ddbe86957c16d93f2b4be8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+4x-32=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />. By Vieta's our roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> amount to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/0/b904ef184eaae9c85698c7cb72bdc8e4073835e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-32}{1}=\\boxed{-32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~Geometry285\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Accuracy_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/9/a6939756df77a791e38e3291babae065e55eedc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+2}{6}=\\frac{6}{x+2} \\implies x^2+4x-32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"267\" height=\"40\" /> Therefore, the product of the root is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43b27e78a52924deeb2b1c266b916211ead13d32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-32$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> \n</p><p>~kante314\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Accuracy_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The only numbers that are their own reciprocals are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/0/d000f0191d0ca3ac62df1dd7014d71d945ccde0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+2}{6}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" /> has the solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7d65cfa316d639c9267398009812f3eb45fea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, while the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/4/ae4f3b5d8888ad5b352762a6fe537d66d78616ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+2}{6}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" /> has the solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/9/54990ca80f4f717ba27504691f518e8acbcfcad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-8$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/4391f2872065dea570dbf5a65629c089bda2a09b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\cdot (-8)=\\boxed{-32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"129\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~tigerzhang\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Accuracy_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Accuracy_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Accuracy Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Accuracy Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Accuracy_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Accuracy Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Accuracy Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018015845\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 140/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 183/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4233/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.378      1 Template:JMPSC_Notice\n100.00%    5.378      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21583:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018015845 and revision id 158065. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}